WEBVTT

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.050
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,</i>
<i>the time has finally come!</i>

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:20.020
Let's begin the matches in Block C!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.850
SUEKICHI KANEDA
NAOYA OHKUBO

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.350
Look, Lihito. They're provocative.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.310
RYO HIMURO
LIHITO

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.020
I totally agree with you, Ohkubo.

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:30.360
Hey, I exchanged phone numbers
with that long-haired girl yesterday.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:31.440
What?

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.110
KAEDE AKIYAMA
KAZUO YAMASHITA

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.450
Hi, welcome back.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.950
-And you, President Yamashita.
-Hello.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.910
How's Ohma?

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:42.910
Are you talking about me?

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.000
OHMA TOKITA

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.710
Oh, you woke up?
You're not fatigued anymore?

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:50.500
Huh?
I'm not feeling fatigued.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.670
-<i>I'm relieved.</i>
-Who're you anyway?

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:55.260
-<i>He looks okay.</i>
-You forgot me?

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.550
SAYAKA KATAHARA
THE DAUGHTER OF METSUDO KATAHARA

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.390
We're about to begin the ninth game!

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:03.980
Please welcome our first fighter!

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:09.770
<i>This guy is the most vigorous</i>
<i>kengan fighter.</i>

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.900
<i>He roars while fighting</i>
<i>and howls upon winning.</i>

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:16.860
<i>Which means he yells anytime, anywhere!</i>

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:21.290
<i>Standing at 184 cm and weighing 88 kg,</i>

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:25.160
<i>his kengan match record is</i>
<i>17 wins and no losses.</i>

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:30.210
Total assets he has acquired are
200 billion 969 million yen.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:34.840
Representing Village of Dawn,
also known as Howling Fighting Spirit,

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:36.340
Saw Paing Yoroizuka!

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.010
REPRESENTATIVE FIGHTER, VILLAGE OF DAWN

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:40.010
Oh my gosh!

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:43.520
<i>He dashed out,</i>
<i>ignoring his entrance direction!</i>

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:46.890
Life-or-Death Tournament, here I come!

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.190
KORINMARU AJIRO
PRESIDENT OF AJIRO FISHERIES

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:50.190
<i>Yeah! Go me!</i>

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.480
That young man looks full of energy.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.320
No, he's just stupid.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:58.320
He doesn't know
how to control himself at all.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:00.410
Oh, he doesn't?

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.780
Then, Mr. Yoroizuka...

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.330
S. YOROIZUKA
MAYOR OF VILLAGE OF DAWN

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:04.410
...does that mean he...

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.330
<i>Cheer for me as usual, Sayaka!</i>

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:08.500
Yes, Saw Paing knows nothing about it.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.580
<i>Not today. I need to be impartial.</i>

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.590
There is no way I can tell him...

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:13.590
<i>Sorry, Saw.</i>

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:18.680
...that this match is a frame-up.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:54.940
"THE FISHERMAN"

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:59.570
I think you've taken drastic action.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:00.990
J. REINHOLD & K. HAYAMI

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.360
Those two, Yoroizuka and Karo...

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:03.990
REN NIKAIDO
PRESIDENT OF BYAKUYA SHIMBUN

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.950
You have two of your pawns
fighting each other in the first round.

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:10.950
The match is fixed so that the fighter can
preserve his stamina. Is that your plan?

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:16.290
<i>Did he change the rules</i>
<i>to easily fix the match</i>

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.460
<i>just to mess with me?</i>

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.590
<i>Metsudo Katahara.</i>

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.590
<i>Fine.</i>

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:27.510
<i>The long conflict between us</i>
<i>is finally going to end.</i>

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:32.890
<i>Some legends have been handed down</i>
<i>among the men of the sea for many years.</i>

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:38.480
<i>It is said one man strangled a man-eating</i>
<i>great white shark in the ocean.</i>

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:42.860
<i>This man also sank the ship of</i>
<i>an environmental organization</i>

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:45.780
<i>which was trespassing</i>
<i>into Japanese waters.</i>

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:50.370
<i>Furthermore, he caught</i>
<i>the international terrorist, Paul Manson.</i>

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:55.290
<i>All these legends tell of</i>
<i>the great deeds this man has performed.</i>

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:58.250
<i>Traversing the raging waves</i>
<i>of the Sea of Japan,</i>

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:02.010
<i>the legendary giant has arrived!</i>

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:07.300
<i>Standing at 206 cm and weighing 165 kg,</i>

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.260
<i>he makes his kengan match debut today.</i>

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:15.730
Representing Ajiro Fisheries, also known
as the Giant of the Sea of Japan,

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:20.320
<i>Yoshinari Karo!</i>

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:27.240
YOSHINARI KARO
REP. FIGHTER OF AJIRO FISHERIES

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:30.120
<i>The man of the sea is</i>
<i>leaving port at last!</i>

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:34.910
It's a vigorous guy versus a giant.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.460
Here we have the fighters on both sides!

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:43.380
Yeah!

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:44.630
Saw Paing will win.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:46.840
KAOLAN WONGSAWAT
REPRESENTATIVE FIGHTER OF YAZU TRADING

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.760
Do you have a personal relationship
with that man?

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.470
TADASHI IIDA,
PRES. OF YAZU TRADING

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.760
Yes, against my will.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.890
It was years ago.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:06:00.230
<i>In a village in Thailand,</i>
<i>along the border of Myanmar,</i>

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:07.030
<i>the annual martial arts competition</i>
<i>between Thailand and Myanmar was held.</i>

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:11.910
<i>I joined as a representative</i>
<i>for Thailand only once.</i>

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:17.580
<i>Back when I was 15, I was already</i>
<i>the strongest in the country.</i>

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:22.090
<i>But I met him in the competition.</i>

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.960
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:26.130
<i>You made me excited!</i>

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.970
<i>It was excellent!</i>

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.260
<i>I finally found...</i>

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:31.600
SAW PAING (THEN-16-YEARS-OLD)
REPRESENTATIVE OF MYANMAR

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:32.800
<i>...my predestined rival!</i>

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:36.060
<i>His annoying nature hasn't changed</i>
<i>since then.</i>

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:40.020
<i>I won the game by the referee's decision,</i>

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:45.190
<i>but it was the only game in my career</i>
<i>I didn't win by knocking out the opponent.</i>

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:47.440
<i>Since then,</i>

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.160
<i>he came to challenge me</i>
<i>wherever I was, day and night,</i>

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:53.780
<i>even crossing the border.</i>

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:57.290
I thought it was strange
not to see him recently,

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.540
but I didn't really expect we'd reunite
in a situation like this.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:02.880
You just wait, Kaolan.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.750
I'm going to win!

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:09.050
Now let's get started, old buddy!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:13.930
<i>What a boring act, you trickster.</i>

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.770
During the match,
Karo will lose his balance.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.310
That's the plan, right?

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:22.520
Yes.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:28.150
Anyway, since Saw Paing is so stupid,
I'm sure he won't realize that it's fixed.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:30.400
Hey, you two.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:32.160
Ready to fight?

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:35.160
Take your positions.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.580
<i>Well, Jerry.</i>

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:41.210
You watched Karo's fight
up close in the preliminary.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.870
JERRY TYSON
(ELIMINATED)

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:44.710
What was your impression of him?

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:49.340
Above all, Karo's advantages are
his power and his toughness.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.800
Since Saw Paing has a smaller body,

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:57.060
whether he can get around Karo's attack
will determine who will win.

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:58.180
I see.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.730
<i>Saw Paing is an aggressive fighter.</i>

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:06.060
<i>Can he push his way through</i>
<i>against the enormous Karo?</i>

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:07.900
Take your stance.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:14.070
<i>What's that stance?</i>

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:16.830
Fight!

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:18.280
Whatever.

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:23.000
Whoa! Saw Paing is making the first move.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.000
He's digging his own grave!

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.880
<i>I'm not a martial arts fighter.</i>

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:33.470
<i>He's just small fry</i>
<i>compared to what I've fought.</i>

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:38.140
<i>To save our fishery and family,</i>

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.930
<i>I've always taken down</i>
<i>any kind of target.</i>

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.600
<i>With my skill and...</i>

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:45.230
<i>my harpoon!</i>

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.270
WHALE BURIAL

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.280
<i>We no longer have a choice.</i>

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.860
<i>Once the frame-up falls apart,</i>

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:58.830
<i>there's no escape route for us.</i>

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.620
<i>Victory is the only path to salvation.</i>

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.380
You brat.

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.630
I'm not a "brat."

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.920
Remember my name.

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:16.630
It's Saw Paing...

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:19.550
Yoroizuka!

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:29.730
<i>Saw Paing's fighting style is</i>
<i>not Muay Thai.</i>

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:34.150
<i>It's Myanmar Lethwei, also known as</i>
<i>Burmese bareknuckle boxing.</i>

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.860
<i>It's a traditional martial art</i>
<i>from Myanmar</i>

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:38.990
<i>with a history of over 1000 years.</i>

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:44.330
<i>It permits techniques such as punching</i>
<i>the spinal cord, throwing from clinching,</i>

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:47.210
<i>and other techniques found in Muay Thai.</i>

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:52.090
<i>The biggest difference is that</i>
<i>it is a bare-knuckle fight.</i>

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:57.380
<i>Without wearing gloves,</i>
<i>it's harder to guard effectively.</i>

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:01.140
<i>So, you need to keep attacking</i>
<i>with almost no guard.</i>

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:06.480
<i>The human body is not originally</i>
<i>designed to withstand fistfights.</i>

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:10.810
<i>However, when bones are repeatedly</i>
<i>severely fractured,</i>

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:15.280
<i>the body strengthens the bones</i>
<i>to adapt to an extraordinary environment.</i>

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:18.740
<i>After repeatedly</i>
<i>being broken and strengthened,</i>

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:23.660
<i>the skeleton takes a different form</i>
<i>from the average human body.</i>

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:27.660
<i>It's a martial art to adapt humans</i>
<i>to the environment.</i>

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:31.210
<i>That's Lethwei.</i>

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.210
<i>Karo is down on one knee!</i>

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:36.840
Here I come!

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:39.510
<i>He fended me off...</i>

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:41.340
<i>from that stance?</i>

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.480
<i>A direct hit!</i>

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:56.440
<i>We could hear the awful sound</i>
<i>of bones being cracked!</i>

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.610
I apologize, Mr. Yoroizuka.

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:01.240
If we don't win this tournament,

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.370
we will lose everything.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:04.990
Hey, Wakatsuki.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.290
JUN SEKIBAYASHI

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:09.250
-That old man is...
-Yeah, I know. He is...

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:10.580
TAKESHI WAKATSUKI

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:12.250
...not just a man of muscle.

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:13.880
<i>In the first attack,</i>

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:19.260
<i>Karo hit the spinal cord,</i>
<i>one of the vital spots of the human body.</i>

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:23.470
<i>The impact stops</i>
<i>the spinal cord's activity,</i>

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.600
<i>which provokes a blackout.</i>

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:29.890
<i>There is a technique called "ikejime"</i>
<i>used to break the spinal cord of fish</i>

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.560
<i>to make them brain-dead</i>
<i>and keep them fresh.</i>

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:38.070
<i>Karo's blow was an application</i>
<i>of the "ikejime" technique.</i>

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:42.240
<i>This is Yoshinari Karo, a fisherman</i>
<i>with 40 years of experience.</i>

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:47.490
<i>The man with no martial arts training</i>
<i>launched this practiced attack.</i>

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:50.580
<i>He is totally open to attack as usual.</i>

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:54.380
<i>Wow, what on earth happened to him?!</i>

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:59.010
<i>If his attack hadn't aimed at the head,</i>
<i>you could have lost this game.</i>

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.050
Phew, that was really something, old man!

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:07.890
<i>Karo's fingers are broken,</i>
<i>though he was the one who attacked.</i>

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:11.270
Looks like you're wondering what happened.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:14.100
All righty! I'll explain to you.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.730
The skull is a crucial part to Lethwei.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:19.610
<i>I have a rock-hard skull</i>

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:23.610
<i>that I've toned up every day</i>
<i>since I started Lethwei at five years old.</i>

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.780
<i>You could say it's the hardest helmet.</i>

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:31.660
<i>My skull can completely shelter the brain</i>
<i>from any kind of impact.</i>

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.750
Besides, Lethwei's biggest--

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.000
You're such a chatterbox, kid.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.630
Do you think you've won this game

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:41.050
because of a small injury like this?

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:46.340
Don't get cocky.

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:48.930
We're just getting started.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:52.390
Hell yeah! Let's fight!

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:01.190
<i>Look at Karo!</i>

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:04.610
<i>His right hand was broken, but...</i>

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:06.950
I'm going to beat you out here

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:09.450
and proceed to the next stage!

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:20.710
<i>Holy shit! What a rush!</i>

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:27.510
A perfect hit!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:32.100
What...

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.520
<i>What's that?!</i>

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.400
<i>What on earth is that?</i>

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:40.190
<i>From the obviously unnatural stance,</i>

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:43.320
<i>Karo blows out Saw Paing!</i>

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:46.150
<i>This man's sense of balance is</i>

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:49.410
<i>ridiculously weird for sure!</i>

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.660
<i>Land sickness.</i>

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:56.080
<i>During a long voyage,</i>
<i>you lose your sense of balance.</i>

00:13:56.410 --> 00:14:00.630
<i>Even after getting back on the land,</i>
<i>you feel like you are still on the ocean.</i>

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:07.260
<i>Since fishermen spend</i>
<i>much more time on a ship than on land,</i>

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.300
<i>their bodies adapt to the ocean,</i>
<i>causing this sickness.</i>

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.100
<i>Yoshinari Karo, who's been</i>
<i>a fisherman for 40 years,</i>

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.390
<i>was also suffering from</i>
<i>this land sickness.</i>

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:21.190
<i>The land was something unstable for him.</i>

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:22.650
<i>However...</i>

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:27.820
<i>the last kick from Saw Paing</i>
<i>which hit his temple</i>

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:32.410
<i>shook his brain and made him lose</i>
<i>his sense of balance.</i>

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.240
<i>And here...</i>

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:40.080
<i>Yoshinari Karo has returned to the ocean!</i>

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:44.050
<i>Karo received the kick intentionally.</i>

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:47.920
<i>In that way, he made</i>
<i>his abnormal sense of balance</i>

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:50.090
<i>change back to what's normal for him.</i>

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:53.260
<i>I've never seen a person stronger</i>
<i>than Karo</i>

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:56.600
<i>after recovering from land sickness.</i>

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:58.810
<i>Karo, please.</i>

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:00.480
<i>You have to...</i>

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:03.310
<i>save our ocean!</i>

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.150
What the heck is this?

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:12.740
<i>His core is as strong as Adam Dudley's.</i>

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:16.540
<i>And his sense of balance is</i>
<i>no less than that of Keizaburo Sawada.</i>

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.710
Despite his bulk... amazing!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.580
Yoshinari Karo is...

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.460
<i>a formidable fighter.</i>

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:35.220
<i>Prepare yourself,</i>
<i>you Toyo Electric Power dogs.</i>

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:39.480
<i>I'm going to make you pay for sure.</i>

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:43.770
Interesting.

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:46.900
You make me so excited!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:49.780
<i>Leaning forward?</i>

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.660
<i>Okay, that's right.</i>

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:55.200
<i>Don't get distracted by small tricks.</i>

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:59.660
<i>If you can't beat him by keeping distance,</i>
<i>you should just change to infighting.</i>

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:04.040
<i>Or... while I'm in this country,</i>
<i>should I call it</i>

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.340
<i>a suicide attack?</i>

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:09.300
<i>I'm going to finish him</i>
<i>with the next round of strikes.</i>

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:11.550
<i>Whatever it takes,</i>

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:12.760
<i>I'm going to win!</i>

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:16.550
<i>I shall take your offer.</i>

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:21.020
<i>I'll blow away</i>
<i>all of Toyo Electric Power's dogs!</i>

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.270
They're moving!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:29.480
<i>Karo and Saw Paing moved</i>
<i>at the same moment.</i>

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:32.030
<i>For a few seconds before colliding,</i>

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.860
<i>neither of them were sure yet,</i>

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:38.370
<i>which is the best attack.</i>

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:41.790
<i>The wrong choice could result in a loss.</i>

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:44.040
<i>And Saw Paing's first attack was</i>

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:45.790
<i>a front kick.</i>

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:02.060
<i>The decisive attack was</i>

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:03.730
<i>Yoshinari Karo's...</i>

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.100
<i>bear hug!</i>

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:18.070
<i>Which was followed by</i>

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.780
<i>Saw Paing Yoroizuka's...</i>

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:24.160
<i>elbow strike on the cervical spine.</i>

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:29.500
Hey, old man.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:31.550
You were...

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.760
quite a guy!

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:38.760
<i>Our...</i>

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:40.300
<i>ocean...</i>

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:43.980
<i>Are you going to close our fishing port?!</i>

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:48.600
<i>This is the port with one of the biggest</i>
<i>fishing yields in Japan.</i>

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.060
AJIRO FISHERIES

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.940
<i>Did Toyo Electric Power tell you so?</i>

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.440
<i>Right.</i>

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:57.820
<i>They're going to construct</i>
<i>a resort facility for their employees.</i>

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:01.330
<i>For such a stupid reason?</i>

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:04.950
<i>They offered us a deal.</i>

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:08.460
<i>If we want them to change</i>
<i>the construction site,</i>

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:12.960
<i>we need to join the tournament</i>
<i>as a pawn of Toyo Electric Power Co.</i>

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:19.800
<i>After I won the prelim, Hayami told me...</i>

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:24.810
<i>that they'd stay away from our port</i>
<i>if I was complicit in their frame-up.</i>

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:27.180
<i>However...</i>

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:34.530
<i>I received an anonymous envelope</i>
<i>last night,</i>

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:38.740
<i>and found a USB flash drive in it.</i>

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.740
<i>Who the hell sent it to me?</i>

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:46.540
<i>What I saw on it...</i>

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.370
<i>was despair.</i>

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:54.000
<i>Around the electrical power plant</i>
<i>that would replace the port,</i>

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:59.260
<i>they were planning to rebuild our town</i>
<i>into Hayami's own empire.</i>

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:04.510
<i>We were just being used...</i>

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:07.180
<i>by that devil.</i>

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.770
<i>I decided</i>

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:15.690
<i>to take revenge on</i>
<i>Toyo Electric Power for sure.</i>

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:20.610
<i>I will... for sure...</i>

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:23.200
The game is over!

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:27.160
The winner is Saw Paing Yoroizuka.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:30.870
Yeah!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.210
<i>He won!</i>

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:37.800
<i>Saw Paing advances to the second stage!</i>

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:40.970
You'd better run.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:42.010
Sorry?

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:45.890
That man has no mercy for a traitor.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:49.850
I'll take care of Karo.

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:53.150
For now,
you should just run away from him.

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:59.530
<i>Even after seeing their plan fall apart,</i>

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:02.280
<i>Toyo Electric Power hasn't said a word.</i>

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:05.320
<i>So that's what it is?</i>

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.200
<i>That man is just playing.</i>

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:11.000
<i>Katsumasa Hayami.</i>

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:15.710
<i>He thinks the tournament is</i>
<i>no more than a kid's game.</i>

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.460
<i>I don't like it.</i>

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.130
<i>Katsu.</i>

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:26.180
Come on, tea.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:28.100
Oh, Mr. Yamashita.

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:30.680
Hello.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.890
You are, um...

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.230
I'm Tomoko of Kouou.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:35.270
TOMOKO MATSUDA

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:38.440
Oh, hi. And you are?

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:40.940
Let me introduce him to you.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:43.950
This is our representative fighter.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.780
I'm Setsuna Kiryu.

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:46.910
SETSUNA KIRYU

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:48.240
It's nice to meet you.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.660
Nice to meet you, too.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:51.950
Hmm?

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:59.040
It's...

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:00.960
It's Mockey!

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:03.010
What are you doing here?

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:05.930
I really love Mockey!

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:06.890
<i>Uh-huh.</i>

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:09.560
I have a lifetime pass
for Tochigi Destinyland.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:13.270
Destinyland? That brings back memories.

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:16.480
I took my sons there several times
when they were little.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:20.400
I'm not so familiar with it.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:22.360
By the way...

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:25.740
do you think
this stuffed animal suit will fight?

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:29.200
Of course not. I think it's here
just as a mascot.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:32.500
<i>So this is Ohma's employer.</i>

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:34.870
<i>I don't get a bad impression,</i>

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:36.920
<i>he's probably a good man.</i>

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:39.500
There you are, Mockey.

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:41.460
This voice is...

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:43.260
It's about time, huh?

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:44.800
Honald, it's you!

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:48.550
Hmm? I don't remember this character.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:52.390
This is Honald, Mockey's best friend!

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:55.140
Wow, those characters have
background stories?

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:57.810
You know so much about them, Tomoko.

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:03.280
Of course I do
because I became fascinated with them

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:07.070
when I saw their love story
in anthropomorphic figures!

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:10.280
Fascinated... anthropomorphic...?

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.450
It just means she loves them after all.

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:16.210
Are you ready, Mockey?

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.290
Huh?

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:19.630
Is that voice...

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:21.840
Mockey?

00:22:25.090 --> 00:22:27.880
No, Mockey!

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:29.890
Let's go...

00:22:30.590 --> 00:22:32.560
end dreams.

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:06.860
PREVIEW

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:09.110
<i>A good-looking but unidentified fighter.</i>

00:24:09.230 --> 00:24:11.820
<i>Watch out for a beautiful, obscene object!</i>

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:15.120
<i>His beauty hides a terrifying sin.</i>

00:24:15.530 --> 00:24:18.410
<i>Another Ashura is now awakening!</i>

00:24:18.490 --> 00:24:19.830
<i>Next episode: "The Rakshasa."</i>

00:24:20.200 --> 00:24:21.830
Subtitle translation by Hinako Someno
